      "updated": 1768465976269,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Bigrams \nA sequence of two adjacent tokens from a text corpus. \neg (Words): In \"The quick brown fox\", bigrams are (\"The\", \"quick\"), (\"quick\", \"brown\"), (\"brown\", \"fox\").  \neg (Characters): In \"cat\", bigrams are (\"c\", \"a\"), (\"a\", \"t\"). \n \nPredict most probable next token basis given token\neg: given \"ca\" -> predict what will come after \"a\"",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Bigrams \nA sequence of two adjacent tokens from a text corpus. \neg (Words): In \"The quick brown fox\", bigrams are (\"The\", \"quick\"), (\"quick\", \"brown\"), (\"brown\", \"fox\").  \neg (Characters): In \"cat\", bigrams are (\"c\", \"a\"), (\"a\", \"t\"). \n \nPredict most probable next token basis given token\neg: given \"ca\" -> predict what will come after \"a\"",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
